  [ok ] T4 Q3: mu == 1 identically on the degenerate branch (no MOND)   field equations are exactly GR + Lambda
  [ok ] T4 Q4: Phi - Psi = 0 and alpha_1 = alpha_2 = 0 exactly -- VACUOUS passes
    NOTE, AND IT BEARS ON THE STAGE-1 SCREEN.  If V'(-3/25) < 0 the constant-norm
